  characterData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7d0e694a6a7919c47b9de361066c4730, type: 2}
  Dialog: Following the head butler's information, I find myself rounding a corner
    into a lavishly decorated bar with ruby-red velvet stools bathed in warm, golden
    hues that bounce off the mirrors along the walls. A single chandelier hangs from
    the ceiling, giving the room a muted glow. The bartender is sitting alone behind
    the bar, seemingly lost in thought. Leaving the head butler to wait at the entrance,
    I approach the bartender.
